      "created_at": "2016-01-15T20:30:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"seesome\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/seesome/48/2018_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> seesome:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The blank sheet confused me as well so I went through the GTG site to find something that mentioned how many art prints there would be.&nbsp; Confirmation that it's supposed to be three prints can be found on the <a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/store/sentinels-of-the-multiverse-villains-of-the-multiverse\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">GTG Store page for VotM</a>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Huh. We assumed it was an art print of Absolute Zero creating a blizzard while fighting Chokepoint to keep the local temperatures low…</p>\n<p>(Full disclosure: A friend actually came up with this. I'm not that funny.)</p>",
