      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/balothejester/{size}/2080_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-01-18T23:11:20.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I figured that was what the blank sheet was, thanks for confirming before I even had to ask!</p><p>Separate but related question: Does anyone know the dimensions of the art prints? I ordered some frames only to find they were too small (luckily we had wedding photos that needed framing in that size, but I still need to figure out where I went wrong...)</p>",
